---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Property Inspection Report Ghana — Move-In & Move-Out | PRC" description="Professional property inspection in Ghana with condition assessment, photos, repair estimates, and a written advisory report.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Property Inspection & Advisory Report</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Professional property inspection with detailed condition assessment, photographic record, cost-to-repair estimates, and a written advisory report.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">A property inspection serves multiple critical purposes:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li><strong>Dispute Prevention:</strong> Document property condition when tenant moves in, so you have proof if they cause damage</li>
          <li><strong>Rent Justification:</strong> Show magistrate why a property is worth its rent</li>
          <li><strong>Maintenance Planning:</strong> Know what repairs are urgent vs. can wait</li>
          <li><strong>Insurance Claims:</strong> Have documented evidence of condition and damage</li>
          <li><strong>Property Valuation:</strong> Support asking price if you sell</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Accountability:</strong> Formal inspection record holds tenants accountable for damage</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>This is evidence you'll be glad to have if anything goes wrong.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Site Visit:</strong> We visit the property and inspect all areas</li>
          <li><strong>Condition Assessment:</strong> Detailed notes on structure, electrical, plumbing, finish, appliances</li>
          <li><strong>Photographic Record:</strong> 20–40 high-quality photos documenting condition</li>
          <li><strong>Repair Estimates:</strong> Cost estimates for needed repairs and maintenance</li>
          <li><strong>Priority Assessment:</strong> Which repairs are urgent, which can wait</li>
          <li><strong>Written Report:</strong> Professional report with findings and recommendations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Uses of This Report</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Compare move-in condition vs. move-out (document tenant damage)</li>
          <li>Support rent level in Rent Control dispute</li>
          <li>Plan maintenance budget and schedule</li>
          <li>Support insurance claims for damage</li>
          <li>Inform buyers if you're selling</li>
          <li>Evidence of property condition for legal disputes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You're renting a property for the first time (baseline inspection)</li>
          <li>You're taking over a property from another owner</li>
          <li>You've had maintenance issues and need documentation</li>
          <li>A tenant has caused damage and you want evidence</li>
          <li>You're about to dispute rent level with tenant or Rent Control</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The Real Value</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Without an inspection report, you're relying on memory and say-so. With one, you have professional documentation. In a dispute, this is the difference between winning and losing.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 400 – 800</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Depends on property size and complexity</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Turnaround: 2–4 working days (includes site visit + report)</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
